---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Current Tenants
permalink: /current-tenants/
description: For current Bahr Family Properties tenants — your resident portal on Apartments.com, pay rent, request maintenance, and send a message.
intakeForms: true
---
<div class="wrap page">
  <h1>Current Tenants</h1>
  <p class="lede">Your resident portal, rent, maintenance, and messages — the doors are on this page.</p>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="portal-h">
    <h2 id="portal-h">Your resident portal</h2>
    <p>Your resident account is on Apartments.com. Your rent balance, your payments, and messages live there.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.apartments.com/">Go to Apartments.com</a></p>
  </section>

  <div class="doors-row">
    <section class="door-card" id="pay-rent" aria-labelledby="pay-rent-h">
      <h2 id="pay-rent-h">Pay rent</h2>
      <p>Rent is paid through Apartments.com. This website never takes rent.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.apartments.com/">Pay rent on Apartments.com</a></p>
    </section>
    <section class="door-card" id="request-maintenance" aria-labelledby="maintenance-h">
      <h2 id="maintenance-h">Request maintenance</h2>
      <p>Tell us what needs fixing at your home.</p>
      <form class="intake-form" data-intake-form="maintenance_request">
        <label>Your name
          <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120">
        </label>
        <label>Your home's address
          <input type="text" name="address" autocomplete="street-address" required maxlength="240">
        </label>
        <label>What's wrong
          <textarea name="problem" required maxlength="2000"></textarea>
        </label>
        <span class="intake-hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label>Leave this field empty
            <input type="text" name="bfp_hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          </label>
        </span>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Send maintenance request</button>
        <p class="intake-status" data-intake-status role="status"></p>
      </form>
      <p>For an emergency: business phone line: to be set up.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="door-card" id="send-a-message" aria-labelledby="message-h">
      <h2 id="message-h">Send a message</h2>
      <p>Messages go through your resident portal on Apartments.com — there is no inbox on this website.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.apartments.com/">Open the resident portal</a></p>
      <p>Business phone line: to be set up.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
